<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-TW">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>前往付款中…</title>
  <style>
    body { margin: 0; font-family: sans-serif; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-height: 100vh; background: #fdf6f0; color: #444; }
    .box { text-align: center; }
    .spinner { width: 40px; height: 40px; border: 4px solid #f3c5c5; border-top-color: #e07a7a; border-radius: 50%; animation: spin .8s linear infinite; margin: 0 auto 16px; }
    @keyframes spin { to { transform: rotate(360deg); } }
    p { font-size: 14px; color: #888; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="box">
    <div class="spinner"></div>
    <p>正在前往綠界付款頁面，請稍候…</p>
  </div>

  <form id="ecpay-form" method="POST" action="<%= aioUrl %>">
    <% for (const [key, value] of Object.entries(params)) { %>
    <input type="hidden" name="<%= key %>" value="<%= value %>" />
    <% } %>
  </form>

  <script>document.getElementById('ecpay-form').submit();</script>
</body>
</html>
